      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.04 (down from ₹0.08 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹492.2m (up 6.1% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹17.9m (down 55% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 3.6% (down from 8.6% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 10% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 2% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
